/E (Repeat until your dog starts to understand that backing off is what makes the reward happen. Then slowly open your hand with the treat visible. Your dog should now ignore it. If they move toward it or try to take it, close your hand again. Reopen only once they have backed off and settled.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
430 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
